  "scope": "D318 isolated meet-bound update once per valid expanded vertex instead of once per successful neighbor improvement. Same conservative band64/batch32/count-balanced sides/full64 distances/stale reopens/CSR/parser/heap/maps/threads/flags/PGO/output. Every opposite tentative label is a real path, so candidate best remains a valid complete route. Requires new whole-batch/cross-frontier/adjacent-cut/correct-label-reopen/zero/exhaustion/full64/independent Floyd proof before promotion; primary ordinary bidirectional stopping discussion is not a theorem for this batched variant. Fewer opposite-map probes can lose if useful meets are delayed, no performance/score presumed. No answer/seed/host/counter/exemption change.",
